{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOCheckboxIndeterminate","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/Controls"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Indicator-states","type":"heading","text":"Indicator states"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The checkbox indicator has three available states:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"selected"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": the checkbox is filled with a tick, the user has made the action to select the checkbox"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"unselected"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": the checkbox is empty, does not contain a tick, the user has made the action to unselect or did not select yet the checkbox"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"indeterminate","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": like a prefilled or preticked checkbox, the user did not do anything on it yet"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In you are looking for a checkbox with only two possible values, refer to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckbox","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Particular-cases","type":"heading","text":"Particular cases"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxIndeterminate","type":"reference"},{"text":" can be related to an error situation, for example troubles for a form.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A dedicated look-and-feel is implemented for that if the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isError"},{"text":" flag is risen.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","type":"heading","text":"Accessibility considerations"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note also the component must be instanciated with a string parameter used as accessibility label."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It is a good pratice (at least) to define a label for a component without text for accessibility reasons. This label will be vocalized by "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Voice Over","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The vocalization tool will also use, after the label, a description of the component (if disabled, if error context), and a fake trait for checkbox."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Cases-forbidden-by-design","text":"Cases forbidden by design","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have both an error situation and a disabled component."}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Code-samples","text":"Code samples","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"code":["    \/\/ Supposing we have an indeterminate state checkbox","    @Published var selection: MISOCheckboxIndicatorState = .indeterminate","","    \/\/ A simple checkbox, no error, not in read only mode","    MISOCheckboxIndeterminate(selection: $selection, accessibilityLabel: \"The cake is a lie\")","","    \/\/ A simple checkbox, but is an error context","    MISOCheckboxIndeterminate(selection: $selection, accessibilityLabel: \"The cake is a lie\"), isError: true)","","    \/\/ Never disable an error-related checkbox as it will crash","    \/\/ This is forbidden by design!","    MISOCheckboxIndeterminate(selection: $selection, accessibilityLabel: \"The cake is a lie\"), isError: true).disabled(true) \/\/ fatal error"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"name":"Version","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"2.4.0 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note"},{"name":"Since","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS 0.12.0","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxIndeterminate\/init(selection:accessibilityLabel:isError:isReadOnly:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxIndeterminate\/init(selection:accessibilityLabel:tableName:bundle:isError:isReadOnly:)"]},{"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxIndeterminate\/body"]},{"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxIndeterminate\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxIndeterminate\/View-Implementations"]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"externalID":"s:14MISOComponents25MISOCheckboxIndeterminateV","title":"MISOCheckboxIndeterminate","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOCheckboxIndeterminate","kind":"ident